      "parameters": {
        "content": "## NFC News Summary\nDaily 7:00 AM (LA) digest of 4 RSS feeds. Also runs manually or via the form (Lookback days + Send to).\n\n**Flow:** run options -> feed list -> read feeds -> keep articles in lookback window -> skip already-sent (only when lookback = 1) -> stop if nothing new -> AI summary per article (2s apart) -> one HTML email.\n\n**Configure these 3 things:**\n1. **Chat model credential** on \"Summarizer Chat Model\"\n2. **Email credential** on \"Send Digest Email\" (Gmail)\n3. **Recipient address**: replace YOUR_EMAIL@example.com in \"Set Run Options\"",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 4
      },
